{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> be the minimum of the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b67f07fb08ba15cd2421bc6fc18d1243b6bd94de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x+1, x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/0/1f0f91851343326953ae1d457121b269f5e3bd6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />. Then the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/575dd9c22afafb6201b89efbfdc83e3fd2adc214.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad  \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad  \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{2}{3} \\qquad  \\text{(D)} \\ \\frac{5}{2} \\qquad  \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"349\" height=\"37\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66e9a61677a89182415210bdac41f21f62d3cb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) = 4x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffd6b886cd5d28e9ca7d886dc21cfa059ac7c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) = x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1d3dc1df9b80f99c181da4aca6b28d4b6acd12f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(x) = -2x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb4dcfbeafe9cedf00c39db9287505cbda14819d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\min(a(x), b(x), c(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a67fceabbb691d100b16398d725a95796981aac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) - b(x) = 3x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740650e524c359c8eddcd7e219d949d2161a6fa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) &gt; b(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca3747eb66149336b68f28a3f0a46044c603c16e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abefed63062f26400e2be71a1fe526f7fc9f768e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) = b(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46fbdac9561476d9fa69c150b086303843a5832c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5adc8a464f3cbba8b4ef6c046e38822b5f0d5fc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) &lt; b(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f94b7f0488998a0099b30743ffcbb51974472a31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6292bddd7501377eacc527500d2189e3ec32a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) - c(x) = 6x - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/2615e922f1881daddbcef36efd11308d93719dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) &gt; c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/2/9920ef9b368345ff1b6330d2c67383f98c836458.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac1ca8ce0515980615a3f86fdaa8430de744899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) = c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a2542a1a4facceb64f3d35e6612d93e6f6340f93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) &lt; c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531a444af0c90ec019ce0b71347f1099f98b8b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f03133de7d37f37beb06d213c5c5a7ad45a9daf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) - c(x) = 3x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c50b819944698f6827ac648de4360c69bd4ece3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) &gt; c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/6/3d6a5d5b5e083b75ebf70698d1baf30baa37fce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/e/92e905a59061396358266d05ca66b759011f8ada.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) = c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7e72e74ef4f39164427c78e08c86dac811e394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/1/cd1b36855f7703b28e3002b8b4a328de82e8ae6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) &lt; c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e4587b7cc015b5b06f95063713490dbf79b0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23d9f484ba4a13a00bc54eb7be964d26320b0c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f2b102e964a66cafff2bd2f2e598c3309c1319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x) \\leq b(x) &lt; c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/7591ee72234fdbbb807d52f40998099ac107f994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = a(x) = 4x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a21d83e9b6424d0f55150a3d79962d14010351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} \\leq x \\leq \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/2/96242642500080dedf5101930edf963df4229436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) \\leq a(x) \\leq c(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1969a2c7c210eca9d9fde54fd1aea3432222fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = b(x) = x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac2573917c265d18043fb816751e955412da535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\leq x \\leq \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10366b3152854b8fe3d48e52d266f3896ee04d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b(x) \\leq c(x) \\leq a(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1969a2c7c210eca9d9fde54fd1aea3432222fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = b(x) = x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f4edbbe100554299fb02f46cac229181f6e179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/84701812f5870695c47e91e23fd0b90ae38fc82a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c(x) \\leq b(x) &lt; a(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/1994b8f6c3ea5fd99f871261f3ca2e9cf774ebb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = c(x) = -2x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is increasing while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e4587b7cc015b5b06f95063713490dbf79b0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> and decreasing while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/6/3d6a5d5b5e083b75ebf70698d1baf30baa37fce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, and therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is maximized at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7e72e74ef4f39164427c78e08c86dac811e394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, with a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2dbc57352cb769bce124d84407e1ef14bb84903a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right) = \\frac{2}{3} + 2 = \\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ \\frac{8}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"204\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016212049\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 313/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9347/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.974      1 -total\n 59.96%    7.779      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 38.04%    4.935      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13186:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016212049 and revision id 257832. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}